{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Add Cloud mode" : {
      "comment" : "Paywall (D-093): a switch at the first purchase that buys Pairline Full Access together with Cloud mode, for less than the two apart.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "إضافة الوضع السحابي" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Add Cloud mode" } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "افزودن حالت ابری" } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bulut modunu ekle" } }
      }
    },
    "Save %lld%%" : {
      "comment" : "Paywall (D-093): a badge on \"Add Cloud mode\": the whole percent saved buying Full Access and Cloud mode together, worked out from the store's own prices (e.g. 30).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "وفّر %lld٪" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save %lld%%" } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld٪ صرفه‌جویی" } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%%%lld tasarruf" } }
      }
    },
    "Texts, codes and calls over the internet when your phones are apart. Both for %@ instead of %@; added later, Cloud mode alone costs %@." : {
      "comment" : "Paywall (D-093), under \"Add Cloud mode\". The first %@ is the bundle's price (e.g. $20.99), the second Full Access and Cloud mode bought apart (e.g. $29.98), the third Cloud mode alone bought later (e.g. $19.99).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "الرسائل والرموز والمكالمات عبر الإنترنت حين يكون هاتفاك بعيدين. كلاهما معًا بسعر %1$@ بدلًا من %2$@؛ وإذا أضفته لاحقًا فسعر الوضع السحابي وحده %3$@." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Texts, codes and calls over the internet when your phones are apart. Both for %1$@ instead of %2$@; added later, Cloud mode alone costs %3$@." } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "پیامک‌ها، کدها و تماس‌ها از راه اینترنت، وقتی گوشی‌هایتان از هم دورند. هر دو با هم %1$@ به‌جای %2$@؛ اگر بعداً اضافه کنید، حالت ابری به‌تنهایی %3$@ است." } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Telefonlarınız birbirinden uzaktayken internet üzerinden mesaj, kod ve arama. İkisi birlikte %2$@ yerine %1$@; sonradan eklerseniz Bulut modu tek başına %3$@." } }
      }
    },
    "Buy Pairline and Cloud mode for %@" : {
      "comment" : "Paywall (D-093): the buy button with \"Add Cloud mode\" switched on. %@ is the bundle's price, e.g. $20.99.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "شراء Pairline والوضع السحابي مقابل %@" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Buy Pairline and Cloud mode for %@" } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "خرید Pairline و حالت ابری به قیمت %@" } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pairline ve Bulut modunu %@ karşılığında satın al" } }
      }
    },
    "Pairline Full Access and Cloud mode" : {
      "comment" : "Paywall (D-093): the price card's line with \"Add Cloud mode\" switched on.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "الوصول الكامل إلى Pairline والوضع السحابي" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pairline Full Access and Cloud mode" } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "دسترسی کامل Pairline و حالت ابری" } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pairline Tam Erişim ve Bulut modu" } }
      }
    },
    "Cloud mode is part of your free trial. Buy it together with Pairline for %@, or add it later for %@." : {
      "comment" : "Cloud mode's Settings section and pairing step during the free trial (D-093). The first %@ is Full Access + Cloud mode at the first purchase (e.g. $20.99), the second Cloud mode added later (e.g. $19.99).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "الوضع السحابي جزء من فترتك التجريبية المجانية. اشترِه مع Pairline بسعر %1$@، أو أضفه لاحقًا مقابل %2$@." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud mode is part of your free trial. Buy it together with Pairline for %1$@, or add it later for %2$@." } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "حالت ابری بخشی از دوره آزمایشی رایگان شماست. می‌توانید آن را همراه Pairline به قیمت %1$@ بخرید، یا بعداً با %2$@ اضافه کنید." } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bulut modu ücretsiz denemenize dahildir. Pairline ile birlikte %1$@ karşılığında alın ya da sonradan %2$@ karşılığında ekleyin." } }
      }
    },
    "Buy Cloud mode · %@" : {
      "comment" : "Cloud mode add-on (D-093): the buy button, shown only after Pairline Full Access is bought. %@ is the price, e.g. $19.99.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "شراء الوضع السحابي · %@" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Buy Cloud mode · %@" } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "خرید حالت ابری · %@" } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bulut modunu satın al · %@" } }
      }
    },
    "Pairing over the internet is part of Cloud mode, a one-time %@ add-on to Pairline Full Access." : {
      "comment" : "Cloud mode add-on (D-093): shown instead of pairing over the internet when Full Access is bought but the add-on isn't. %@ is the price.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "الإقران عبر الإنترنت جزء من الوضع السحابي، وهو إضافة تُشترى مرة واحدة بسعر %@ إلى الوصول الكامل إلى Pairline." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pairing over the internet is part of Cloud mode, a one-time %@ add-on to Pairline Full Access." } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "جفت کردن از راه اینترنت بخشی از حالت ابری است؛ افزونه‌ای یک‌باره به قیمت %@ برای دسترسی کامل Pairline." } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "İnternet üzerinden eşleştirme, Pairline Tam Erişim'e %@ tutarında tek seferlik bir eklenti olan Bulut modunun parçasıdır." } }
      }
    },
    "Cloud mode is a one-time add-on to Pairline Full Access. Everything nearby keeps working without it." : {
      "comment" : "Cloud mode add-on (D-093): Settings footer and the step after pairing, when Full Access is bought but the add-on isn't.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "الوضع السحابي إضافة تُشترى مرة واحدة إلى الوصول الكامل إلى Pairline. كل ما يعمل والهاتفان قريبان يظل يعمل من دونها." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud mode is a one-time add-on to Pairline Full Access. Everything nearby keeps working without it." } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "حالت ابری افزونه‌ای یک‌باره برای دسترسی کامل Pairline است. هر چه وقتی گوشی‌ها کنار هم‌اند کار می‌کند، بدون آن هم کار می‌کند." } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bulut modu, Pairline Tam Erişim'e tek seferlik bir eklentidir. Telefonlar yakındayken her şey onsuz da çalışmaya devam eder." } }
      }
    },
    "Cloud mode is part of your free trial. After you buy Pairline, it's a one-time %@ add-on." : {
      "comment" : "Cloud mode add-on (D-093): Settings footer and the step after pairing during the free trial. %@ is the add-on's price.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "الوضع السحابي جزء من فترتك التجريبية المجانية. بعد شراء Pairline يصبح إضافة تُشترى مرة واحدة بسعر %@." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud mode is part of your free trial. After you buy Pairline, it's a one-time %@ add-on." } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "حالت ابری بخشی از دوره آزمایشی رایگان شماست. بعد از خرید Pairline، افزونه‌ای یک‌باره به قیمت %@ است." } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bulut modu ücretsiz denemenize dahildir. Pairline'ı satın aldıktan sonra %@ tutarında tek seferlik bir eklentidir." } }
      }
    },
    "Cloud mode needs the free trial or Pairline Full Access." : {
      "comment" : "Cloud mode add-on (D-093): Settings footer when there's no trial running and no Full Access.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "يحتاج الوضع السحابي إلى الفترة التجريبية المجانية أو الوصول الكامل إلى Pairline." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud mode needs the free trial or Pairline Full Access." } },
        "fa" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "حالت ابری به دوره آزمایشی رایگان یا دسترسی کامل Pairline نیاز دارد." } },
        "tr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bulut modu için ücretsiz deneme veya Pairline Tam Erişim gerekir." } }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
